+----------------------------------------------------------------------
| EXMH extentions 
+---------------------------------------------------------------------

EXMH has a number of optional features that require additional
software to be installed. You may want to consider some or all of
these packages:

 * databases/openldap-client
 * mail/faces
 * mail/procmail
 * textproc/antiword
 * textproc/glimpse
 * textproc/ispell
 * audio/rplay

In addition, exmh supports pgp encryption through:

 * security/gnupg[1-2]
 * security/pgp5
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
